message: "If you use this whitepaper in your research, please cite it as:"
title: "Reviving Abandonware with AI-Assisted Porting: The Juggernaut: Revenge of Sovering ARM64 Case Study"
authors:
  - family-names: Abernathy
    given-names: Roy U.
    website: https://royabernathy.info
date-released: "2026-08-19"
version: "1.0.0"
keywords:
  - abandonware
  - game preservation
  - reverse engineering
  - ARM64 porting
  - Unity
  - AI-assisted development
abstract: >-
  Whitepaper documenting the full process of reviving a 32-bit Unity 4.x
  abandonware mobile game (Juggernaut: Revenge of Sovering, 2012) and porting
  it to modern ARM64 Android via Unity 2021 LTS with an autonomous AI coding
  agent. Covers reverse engineering, a verified UnityPy asset-extraction
  pipeline (772 bundles), and human-AI collaboration patterns for software
  archaeology.
